// M3 Q3c. `arena-ultimate`, whose ultimate empties the player's energy, and then a press of the ultimate every
// 20 ticks on top of its rounds. Each press before the hits have filled the meter again fires nothing; the
// first one after that finds the player between moves does, about a second after it filled.
(
    type: "sapphire::gameplay::InputsDocument",
    version: 1,
    data: (
        about: "`arena-ultimate`, then the ultimate pressed again every third of a second while the fight fills its energy back up: it fires once the meter is full, and not before",
        ticks: 900,
        like: "arena-ultimate",
        tracks: [
            (
                presses: [
                    (from: 210, every: 20, at: [(0, [Ultimate])]),
                ],
            ),
        ],
    ),
)
